findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) shelving below soda and tea machines at front counter (splash/debris);
B) register tape storage cabinet at drive thru (splash inside/out);
C) shelving at quesadilla press (food debris);
D) cheese sauce dispenser - general surfaces (food debris);
E) shelf holding cheese sauce dispenser (food debris);
F) shelf with scales and vegetable oil (debris);
G) TVP and meat spice storage bins and carts (general surfaces with splash and buildup);
H) bulk salt, dried onion, and cinnamon sugar bins (general surfaces with buildup);
I) bottom inside reach-in freezer (food crumbs); 
J) walkin cooler shelves used for sauce and raw beef storage (mold/debris);   and
K) cabinet above lobby garbage can (pepper flakes/debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled with varying amounts of buildup:
A) gray condiment packet organizer in lobby (salt/pepper debris & splash in the bottom of compartments);
B) condiment packet storage cabinet in lobby (salt/pepper debris);
C) front counter shelving (splash/debris);
D) shelving beneath quesadilla press (food debris/splash);
E) inside cheese sauce dispenser (general surfaces - food splash);
F) shelf holding cheese sauce dispenser (splash);
G) under bottom microwave on front make line (food debris);
H) fryers - bottom compartment behind mechanicals (grease/food debris);
I) bulk bins/caddies for bean and meat spice storage (crevices/surfaces - food splash/buildup);
J) hot pink fan in back window (dust);   and
K) salt shaker storage shelf in back prep (general buildup).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) reach-in freezer (food debris - bottom inside; splash - ledge of condenser cover under the door);
B) fryers  (grease buildup on surfaces between the two fryers);
C) 2 part sink (sticky splash/buildup - underneath surfaces of basins);
D) 3 part sink (buildup - underneath surfaces of basins);
E) motor storage compartment beneath ice bin at drive thru soda machine (general buildup);
F) shelving unit holding cheese sauce dispenser and bulk chip bins (grease/food debris);   and
G) cheese sauce dispenser (food debris - inside door/general surfaces).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800b - The following food contact surfaces were soiled: 
A) diffusers of soda nozzles (mold);
B) inner/outer surfaces of bulk sugar and salt containers (food debris/buildup); 
C) cheese sauce dispenser - surfaces inside door and around dispensing tube (food splash/debris).

Clean and sanitize food contact surfaces and surfaces immediately around food contact surfaces between uses/as needed to prevent cross contamination and eliminate buildup of debris. In-use equipment and utensils must be cleaned and sanitized up to every 4hrs after continuous use.
